### 🇺🇸 English Version

# Android Kernel (OPPO sm8250) - Gamepad Driver Backport

This repository is a modified Linux 4.19 kernel for OPPO sm8250 devices. It is forked from [youngguo18/android_kernel_OPPO_sm8250 (stock/13.1)](https://github.com/youngguo18/android_kernel_OPPO_sm8250/tree/stock/13.1).

The primary goal of this fork is to **backport modern gamepad drivers** from the Linux 6.6 kernel (sm8750) to this Linux 4.19 kernel, bringing native support for modern controllers like the PS5 DualSense.

## 📝 Key Changes & Modified Files

* **`drivers/hid/hid-playstation.c`**: Backported from Linux 6.6 to support PS5 DualSense and PS4 DualShock 4 controllers.
    * *Note:* The multicolor LED subsystem support was removed/stubbed to maintain compatibility and pass compilation on the 4.19 kernel.
* **`drivers/hid/hid-sony.c`**: Removed legacy DS4 support (this is now handled entirely by the new `hid-playstation.c` driver to prevent conflicts).
* **`drivers/hid/hid-microsoft.c` & `drivers/hid/hid-nintendo.c`**: Updated/backported for better Xbox and Nintendo controller support.
* **`drivers/Kconfig`**: Updated to include the new driver configurations.
* **`arch/arm64/configs/vendor/kona-perf_defconfig` & `build.sh`**: Build scripts and configurations updated.

### 🛡️ KernelSU (KSU) Notice
The original upstream repository had KernelSU built-in and enabled by default. In this fork, **the KSU compilation options have been disabled** in the config. The KSU source code still remains in the directory tree, so you can easily re-enable it in the `defconfig` if needed.

## 🛠️ Toolchain Setup

Before building, clone the required LineageOS prebuilt toolchains into your `~/kernel` directory:

```bash
mkdir -p ~/kernel
git clone --depth=1 [https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_clang_kernel_linux-x86_clang-r416183b.git](https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_clang_kernel_linux-x86_clang-r416183b.git) ~/kernel/clang
git clone --depth=1 [https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_aarch64_aarch64-linux-android-4.9.git](https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_aarch64_aarch64-linux-android-4.9.git) ~/kernel/gcc64
git clone --depth=1 [https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_arm_arm-linux-androideabi-4.9.git](https://github.com/LineageOS/android_prebuilts_gcc_linux-x86_arm_arm-linux-androideabi-4.9.git) ~/kernel/gcc32
